STATEMENT: >>>
The peer-communication style guide lands first as a dev fragment, so the
fragment system fans it to every ecosystem (Claude rules, Copilot
instructions, Kiro steering, the AGENTS routing index). That is the interim
shape, not the destination: the guide is canon-shaped content, and it should
eventually live in the canon as sdoc nodes with the fragment generated from
them. Doing that needs the projection path in WORK-SDOC-CONTEXT-LOADING, so
this item waits on it.
